            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Fixed
- **The Live Activity on your iPhone stays put.** It used to freeze and then
  disappear on its own when your agents went quiet, and a fresh card could show
  a moment that had already passed. Both are fixed, and updating Perch no longer
  leaves an old card stranded on your lock screen.
]]></description>
